  "tagline": "A manor and pool villas above the Douro, at Lamego.",
  "description": "Six Senses Douro Valley occupies the manor of Quinta de Vale Abraao at Samodaes, 5100-758 Lamego, in the Douro Valley. The hotel counts 71 guest accommodations: rooms, suites and pool villas. Nine Valley Rooms and Suites sit in a renovated wine lodge and can be taken together, up to nine bedrooms. The telephone is +351 254 660 600 and the email is reservations-dourovalley@sixsenses.com.\n\nThe One Bedroom Pool Villa measures 256 square metres, with a private heated pool, a kitchen, a fireplace and a vineyard view, for two guests. The Two Bedroom Pool Villa measures 387.5 square metres. The Quinta Panorama Suite, on the fifth floor, measures 86 square metres and looks over the Douro through floor-to-ceiling windows, with a separate living room. Vineyard Deluxe rooms measure 40 to 41 square metres. On the fourth floor of that wing some rooms have a terrace. On the fifth floor the view is across the vineyard.\n\nThe spa covers 2,200 square metres, with 10 treatment rooms, a vitality suite and a heated indoor pool, and it is open daily from 8:30 to 20:30. A large outdoor pool sits with the indoor one. Dining runs through the Vale de Abraao Restaurant, with a dining room and an open kitchen, Cozinha do Douro, and the Quinta Bar and Lounge. From May to September the Summer Garden adds a fourth place to eat. In the other months the hotel counts three.\n\nFrancisco Sa Carneiro Airport in Porto, printed as OPO, is a 75-minute drive. Lisbon is about four hours by road. The hotel has 10 charging points for electric cars. Check-in is at 15:00 and check-out at 12:00. Pets under 7 kg are allowed. The hotel describes the Douro as a UNESCO World Heritage landscape and as the oldest demarcated wine-growing area.\n\nThe stay suits a few days between the river and the vines. A pool villa is the booking with a private pool. A room in the manor, or the Panorama Suite on the fifth floor, is the booking for the river view. Porto is the airport, 75 minutes away.",
